SY_TALK("Y7LQzo5tNyA",[[39,["I’ll try to cover most of the","points that you have asked but"]],[43,["I must say that I was very happy to","hear most of the questions because"]],[47,["that shows that your enquiry","is getting subtler and subtler;"]],[53,["that you already know","about the gross side of chakras"]],[57,["and now you want to know the subtler forms."]],[64,["Now the first question","which should be taken up first,"]],[71,["is the one, “How the","chakras come into human beings?"]],[76,["What time? What stage of life?”"]],[80,["because that should be the first question."]],[86,["This question is something like if we ask,"]],[90,["“What time a primule comes into the","being of a seed?” is something like that."]],[96,["That a human being when he dies –"]],[100,["as I have told you before he does not die fully"]],[104,["– only a part of him dies which","is mostly the earth element"]],[112,["and the rest of the elements remain there."]],[119,["The rest of the body disappears"]],[126,["and we can’t see it because it","is not a complete human form."]],[133,["It goes on decreasing in size"]],[138,["and the Kundalini leaves the body"]],[146,["and stays outside, outside the body."]],[155,["And the Atma, what we call the Spirit,"]],[161,["also leaves the body, and stays outside","the body, which is the remaining body."]],[171,["The constitution of this new body is different","from our constitution."]],[177,["We can say a light that is extinguished"]],[184,["has all the body except for the light."]],[188,["But the light goes out of that body now."]],[193,["In the same way, in a human being who dies,"]],[199,["the Spirit and the Kundalini leave the body,"]],[203,["but they are around that body."]],[210,["And it’s a great procedure","that follows which is fantastic."]],[216,["It’s unbelievable how the body","disappears, into different elements also."]],[224,["But first of all let us see; when","such bodies which remain like that,"]],[230,["they go into what you call the Pretalok."]],[237,["There they become seeds or they","become smaller and smaller and smaller."]],[245,["Till one body forms an ova and a -"]],[256,["what you know as a sperm."]],[259,["In one body it is formed."]],[262,["I don’t know if you have seen the","division of chromosomes how it takes place?"]],[266,["It’s a complete division."]],[269,["If the chromosome is like that,","it’s a complete vertical division"]],[273,["and a complete separation takes place."]],[277,["That is why marriages"]],[283,["and selection of partners,"]],[290,["all these have a great place."]],[294,["For ordinary bodies it does","not matter for the Divine;"]],[300,["they take place in such a manner that there","can be at random connections established."]],[308,["For example an ova of one may combine"]],[314,["with the sperm of another."]],[320,["It happens at a very lower stage of evolution;"]],[324,["among human beings also it happens like that."]],[327,["For some people who are","just not very evolved, we can say."]],[336,["But mostly the ova rejects the sperms."]],[343,["It only except that sperm","which is meant to be accepted."]],[350,["Now it is such a minute work. It is","so fantastic that it is unbelievable."]],[356,["We have no idea as to how God works out in those."]],[360,["It’s absolutely tremendous that even the ova,"]],[365,["rejects, goes on rejecting the sperm"]],[370,["that is not the second part of itself!"]],[376,["And that’s how so many sperms are","wasted and so many ova’s are wasted."]],[382,["So you can imagine that there is a tremendous","machinery, which is working out this."]],[389,["Specially people who are","realised if, when they are reborn,"]],[395,["all the forces of the Divine","combine to see that these,"]],[401,["this ova is placed with a person"]],[406,["who is ultimately going to meet","the person who has the proper sperm,"]],[410,["so that there is no problem as","far as the meeting is concerned."]],[417,["And the Divine takes all","the care of these great souls."]],[429,["The work of the Divine is very, very fantastic"]],[433,["and it is beyond human conception to","understand how the awareness of God"]],[439,["can look after all the minute","small things of the world."]],[444,["You cannot do even a","small thing like attaching this"]],[448,["to this one unless and until","you pay some human attention."]],[452,["So you can imagine the attention of God"]],[455,["who embeds so many seeds in this Mother","Earth and gives you such huge, big trees."]],[463,["I mean, you have taken them for granted,"]],[466,["but if you watch you will see","this Fantastic, Dynamic Force behind it,"]],[472,["which thinks it, which does it so perfect."]],[478,["But we think that it is all automatic","and that’s how we can bear it,"]],[483,["and that’s how we can bear Sahaj","yoga also, thinking that it is all automatic."]],[489,["The second question is,"]],[492,["“When did the chakras","then are in the body embedded?”"]],[496,["They exist in the body and they go on existing."]],[500,["Of course they get corrected every time the","body takes birth and goes into a new seeking."]],[508,["And the Kundalini also,"]],[511,["every birth you are born, is","watching you as to what you are doing,"]],[517,["how your chakras are","developing, how it is working out."]],[522,["And through the,"]],[529,["method of balancing you or parasympathetic system"]],[533,["or you can call universal unconscious,"]],[537,["the chakras are brought to its proper shape"]],[544,["and to its proper condition by evolution."]],[549,["A man makes mistakes he makes searches,","he searches from one place to another."]],[554,["For example, he may start his search in money,"]],[557,["then he starts his search in power"]],[561,["then he starts his search in love,"]],[564,["I mean the carnal love, or he may","start his search some emotional expressions,"]],[570,["then in art and all those things:"]],[573,["ultimately he finds that the","search has not been alright"]],[580,["because he has not been able to","achieve any state of joyous existence."]],[586,["And with his search these chakras","go on evolving and understanding."]],[592,["Now we have to know that these","chakras are absolutely living entities."]],[600,["Because when a person is supposed to be dead,"]],[607,["that time, all the Deities","are not in the working state."]],[614,["But the living man has the chakras,"]],[621,["which has got the Deities, which work out,"]],[626,["the different functions of the chakras"]],[630,["and it’s a very, very subtle working"]],[633,["and these can be called as the reflecting mirrors"]],[642,["at different levels of our","awareness where the Deities,"]],[649,["which are placed in the Primordial","Being, the Viraata, are reflected"]],[655,["and they, once awakened,"]],[659,["start working out the plans of the Divine."]],[667,["In some of the human beings, when","they are searching these chakras,"]],[674,["find that the person or the subject"]],[682,["is going to the extremes of things"]],[686,["and this comes because a human","being has got freedom to choose."]],[695,["And in his freedom he goes to the extremes,"]],[699,["and by going to the extremes"]],[705,["the chakras get damaged."]],[711,["Going to the extremes is what we call is ‘sin’."]],[716,["To be in the centre, to lead","a moderate, simple balanced life"]],[725,["and stick to the values"]],[730,["of our sustenance is the best life,"]],[735,["but if you start going to the","extremes then the sin starts."]],[742,["And the sin…in the Bible it is written","that, “The wages of sin is death.”"]],[750,["So the death occurs. Now the death","actually, you know, doesn’t take place"]],[755,["but what happens is that the","part of the chakra gets damaged."]],[761,["It can be a physical hankering, it","can be mental, it can be emotional,"]],[765,["it can be spiritual, it can be anything."]],[769,["If you go on working out"]],[774,["an imbalanced solution"]],[778,["then these chakras get spoilt at different points."]],[782,["That’s how your chakras get spoilt."]],[792,["The chakras are,"]],[800,["according to our awareness, in different states."]],[806,["For example for a doctor or for all of us,"]],[812,["we know that we have plexuses in our","body, we know we have different plexuses."]],[817,["Like you can say pelvic","plexus, we have got solar plexus,"]],[823,["we’ve got aortic plexus,","we have got cardiac plexus,"]],[827,["we have got cervical plexus,","we have got optic chiasma,"]],[833,["we’ve got limbic area to act,"]],[838,["or we can say","pituitary and pineal bodies at optic chiasma,"]],[842,["and then we have got limbic area where","we have got certain points which are active."]],[846,["This every doctor knows because","they have even tested the limbic area"]],[850,["of some monkeys and they found that if","you excite the limbic area of the monkeys,"]],[856,["they feel very joyous - with electricity,"]],[860,["So all these chakras,"]],[866,["in the body of a human being,","are only felt as gross expressions,"]],[872,["which we call as ‘plexuses’ in the","parasympathetic and sympathetic channels."]],[879,["They are all connected as I have","told you, that the sympathetic comes"]],[882,["from both the sides and creates the central","channel, and that is the parasympathetic."]],[886,["So it","depends on the balance of both these sympathetics"]],[890,["that the parasympathetic works out well."]],[894,["When the balance breaks up","any balance can upset both of them,"]],[898,["and when it is completely broken","then they become on their own,"]],[902,["and that is how it is the complete","so-called, ‘liberation’ of man from Gods grace."]],[909,["Once he’s completely liberated","from that thing he starts falling"]],[914,["into the state of, as you call them rakshasas."]],[920,["He goes to hell, he goes to the other","kind of awareness where there is no feeling,"]],[926,["no consciousness of conscience."]],[931,["He doesn’t think twice. He can kill a hundred","people without even feeling bad about it."]],[938,["He loses all his emotional side","and also he loses all his wisdom."]],[944,["What remains in him is his own","ambitions and his own desires or his depravity."]],[952,["And he goes on without feeling any compunction"]],[956,["or any binding from the Divine or his own dharma."]],[966,["So these chakras are very","important for us because, first of all,"]],[972,["they give us the balance","for our everyday existence."]],[979,["They give us… (break in recording)…God,"]],[984,["and we can think of subtle","things and abstract things."]],[988,["This all comes through the help of the chakras."]],[994,["If you ask Me if the animals","have the chakras – they have."]],[999,["But they don’t have all of them separated,","sometimes they are confused chakras"]],[1003,["and all the chakras are not separated from","each other and they are not all opened out"]],[1012,["because of their evolutionary","process is not yet complete."]],[1020,["But some animals I have seen","have got an awakened Kundalini"]],[1024,["and they are realised animals I have seen it."]],[1027,["So it is possible, even for animals,","to be very dharmic than men are."]],[1033,["And sometimes it’s surprising how they can","discriminate better than human beings can."]],[1038,["Apart from that animals, are","kept under the bondage of God"]],[1044,["and whatever their sustenance is done","by them; they don’t have to think about it."]],[1051,["For example a dog is a dog,","a cat is a cat, and a tiger is a tiger."]],[1058,["It’s only the human beings can be a dog, can","be a scorpion, can be a snake and can be a saint."]],[1065,["So it’s only a possibility in the human being"]],[1068,["that you can find all the","animals existing side by side,"]],[1071,["and can be any time these animals can come out"]],[1074,["and you may be surprised at yourself the way","they suddenly jump out and start barking at you!"]],[1082,["So that is what human beings are because","whatever has been in our past is within us;"]],[1087,["whatever animals we have been","is within us, so all that is there."]],[1091,["But whatever we are going to be also is there."]],[1096,["And whatever we are","going to achieve is also there."]],[1100,["For human beings the future, past,","present exists, but for God it does not."]],[1105,["So for Him to plan and to organise","and arrange is a very easy stuff"]],[1109,["because if you do not have such demarcating","things you just organise things much better."]],[1114,["And His methods are because of His own,"]],[1119,["I should say awareness,","status, almightiness, I can say"]],[1124,["or it’s just His nature that He’s like","that, that He can manage things very well."]],[1130,["And you cannot explain them","with one event after another event,"]],[1133,["how He has managed and how it has happened."]],[1136,["He does it just because He is","capable of doing that, you see."]],[1142,["He need not do it, all that, with understanding"]],[1147,["or thinking about it as human beings","do because he does not have to think either"]],[1151,["because He is that, you see."]],[1153,["He is the power and He does","everything. He is the consciousness,"]],[1157,["so he does everything","without putting any effort into it."]],[1160,["And is a very different state, which perhaps","you can understand, as Sahaja Yogis, that,"]],[1165,["just you move your hands and you","find the Kundalini moving the other side!"]],[1169,["And you may say, “Why is it moving?”","after all, you must think about it."]],[1172,["You are realised so you can do it","but not a person who is not realised;"]],[1176,["if he put’s hand like that a hundred times nothing is","going to work out. Only you can raise the Kundalini."]],[1181,["The reason is: your awareness is","different and his awareness is the different;"]],[1184,["your powers are different","and his powers are different."]],[1188,["So, in the same way God who is All Powerful,"]],[1192,["for Him even moving His finger He can","move the whole Universe, after all He is God."]],[1197,["And that’s why for human beings it is","said that you better have faith in God"]],[1201,["because that’s the","best way you can solve your problem."]],[1204,["If you go on thinking","about Him you’ll all go crazy!"]],[1207,["So we have to go to a point where we can understand","Him otherwise we will all go crazy understanding Him"]],[1212,["and we all will become mad thinking, “What","all these things! It’s beyond us, it is too much!”"]],[1222,["But because in Sahaja Yoga now your awareness","has come really to such subtler forms,"]],[1228,["one can understand so many things"]],[1232,["and can understand the subtler ways of God’s doing"]],[1238,["and also understand what -"]],[1243,["is possible for you through subtle methods."]],[1246,["We can talk on subtler things but"]],[1249,["talking this to anybody who is not a","Sahaja Yogi would be something madness!"]],[1253,["They wouldn’t understand a word that I’m saying.","It’s only meant for the people who are Sahaja Yogis."]],[1261,["So we came to a point where I said that,"]],[1264,["“In the gross they are expressed","as plexuses in the human being.”"]],[1269,["Now this is known as the gross way.","Now the subtle form you have seen,"]],[1273,["the sukshma as they call it – the subtle","form. The subtle form exists in the human being,"]],[1279,["which you can see – you have seen it – the subtle form as","energy when it starts pulsating, you have seen the pulsation."]],[1286,["But this subtle form is,"]],[1290,["in two forms you","can say, one is a sukshma and ati sukshma."]],[1295,["Because in the sukshma","you can see and a person who"]],[1309,["is a realised soul,"]],[1311,["if you are a realised soul"]],[1315,["then you see even the chakras,"]],[1322,["in the sense you can feel","the chakras on your fingers."]],[1327,["A unrealised soul can see","the pulsation of the Kundalini"]],[1333,["and the different chakras","with his own eyes, he can,"]],[1338,["if he watches it clearly he can","see the different chakras clearly."]],[1343,["And you as Sahaja Yogis","can feel them on your fingers"]],[1347,["and also can feel them within","yourself in the collective consciousness."]],[1355,["There is, you can say, in","the second stage of sukshma,"]],[1362,["there are three stages as you can say:","sukshma, sukshmatara and sukshmatam."]],[1369,["These three things you can see. The","first stage you see is on your fingers,"]],[1377,["is the sukshmatara you can say,","but with the eyes you see is a sukshma"]],[1384,["and if your fingers or on your","chakras when you feel it is,"]],[1389,["you can say, sukshmatam."]],[1392,["So you see them in three forms."]],[1395,["If some of the people","do not feel it on the fingers"]],[1400,["can feel it on the chakras also."]],[1403,["So you can feel it in three","ways but there’s a fourth way"]],[1410,["where you can say it is in","the karana, karana state,"]],[1415,["that’s a higher state where a realised soul can","feel it, who is born as a realised soul can feel it."]],[1421,["And in that state they just know like a computer."]],[1426,["They don’t bother as to which is the one, and they","don’t put hands or anything, they just feel it, it is so."]],[1433,["As you have seen in my granddaughter’s","case, you see she just knows what is what."]],[1437,["Just see, you ask her, she’ll immediately","say, “This is this, this is this,” like."]],[1440,["It comes plain to them absolutely, “This is this.”"]],[1444,["Now you may say that how do they know? But","this procedure becomes such a compact thing,"]],[1449,["I mean it just happens to you, like you pin prick me","here and immediately the hand goes back, you see sort of"]],[1455,["the whole reflex action is so quick"]],[1458,["that we can say there’s no","procedure as such but it’s just a reflex action."]],[1462,["In the same way it acts as a reflex action; so","that you don’t have to worry about the purpose of it."]],[1468,["That is state where we say the karana","state is reached. And the mahakarana state."]],[1475,["Now this is the third stage is it? And even","in the karana stage there are three stages"]],[1481,["into which one feels it.","Now that is, I would say that,"]],[1484,["I need not explain because","that’s beyond you people but"]],[1489,["if you are born realised you will understand that"]],[1493,["the imbalance in a personality of the three gunas,"]],[1500,["see of the three gunas is immediately perceived","by a born realised person, immediately perceived!"]],[1506,["He can see through, you see. That’s the wisdom he","has gained in his previous lives and previous births and"]],[1512,["immediately they can see the imbalance","that comes in. And whatever they say is so wise"]],[1517,["and they understand because they can","see the imbalance of these three gunas."]],[1521,["And according to their own gunas,","whichever are prevalent in them;"]],[1526,["these three stages exist in them the way they say."]],[1529,["For example some people,","have a say are more say, tamogunis:"]],[1537,["means the ones who are very emotional type","people, among them some are very emotional."]],[1542,["So they see a person through the","emotions, the way they feel in themselves."]],[1548,["They call it a feeling. “I had a","feeling for such a person. I felt that way.”"]],[1552,["That is the word they use. But","supposing the person is a rajoguni,"]],[1556,["he has been more towards the going through.."]],[1560,["he has been working on the rajoguna","like praying to Surya and doing Gayatri"]],[1567,["and praying to all the heavenly bodies","and also the five elements, like that."]],[1573,["If he has been doing yagyas","and all those things he’s a rajoguni."]],[1578,["Such people see them","as lights, as electrical forms;"]],[1582,["so they see them as colours and things, you see."]],[1588,["So one sees it as an emotional thing"]],[1592,["another sees it as a colour","or you can say as any form."]],[1597,["They see them as forms, as colours, lights."]],[1604,["They see as electrical currents"]],[1607,["and some see them as a different flowers."]],[1616,["Now they are feelings"]],[1620,["and also they are these rajoguni expressions,"]],[1627,["which you can see with your","eye, you see The Creation itself."]],[1630,["But they are also feelings."]],[1632,["So those who can see feelings more,"]],[1635,["a person who has been very loving","and has dealt in this side of life in.."]],[1641,["who has been a bhakti man, a dedicated man,"]],[1644,["who has been praying to God and crying for Him"]],[1647,["and asking for His help and","weeping before Him with all his heart."]],[1652,["Such a man will feel a person more"]],[1656,["and a person who is a more","dedicated to forms and things"]],[1662,["will see them in a different way as forms so,"]],[1666,["then they see them in colours","because they’re also colours."]],[1670,["They’re also colours and they’re also sounds."]],[1674,["So the sound is also one of the","elements, so they can see a sound."]],[1677,["And they also see them when their Kundalini","moves, you see, they see the sound moving."]],[1682,["and they also saw - Most of the people","who have seen this have been the people"]],[1687,["who have been meditating through this,"]],[1693,["we can say the Patanjali style of meditation"]],[1697,["where they were single people","Parashurama style, you see."]],[1700,["And they saw these forms"]],[1703,["and they saw the movement of","the Kundalini through the chakras,"]],[1709,["when it passes, it creates a sound, a word."]],[1713,["And so they studied every sound how,"]],[1717,["which sound was created, what","sound was created what colour was there."]],[1721,["And so it is the one-sided","knowledge of the right-hand side,"]],[1725,["of the people who went to the","right-hand side that they say that,"]],[1729,["“This thing was created, that thing was","created and then this sound was created.”"]],[1734,["Then they formed the language – it’s the","original Sanskrit language which was formed."]],[1738,["That’s why it’s called as a Devavani."]],[1740,["And that’s why these Deities","understand Sanskrit the best."]],[1744,["When you say Sanskrit mantras you see,","they absolutely understand them very fast"]],[1749,["because this has come originally from there."]],[1751,["They studied that and then it closed off."]],[1754,["But other languages in India,"]],[1759,["most of the languages, were taken from","Sanskrit converted into something else,"]],[1764,["brought to another form and then","another Sanskrit came in – Takruta Sanskrit,"]],[1768,["then these five languages – Magadi,","Paishachi, Marathi, all these languages came in."]],[1773,["So it is derivation. Other languages in","other countries that came up, you see."]],[1779,["was also of course the","expression of the Kundalini,"]],[1784,["but they learnt it more from say,"]],[1789,["the words came from the outside;"]],[1792,["the sound of the air flowing they","call it ‘ssss’, so they call it ’s’ like that."]],[1798,["And from the nature what ever","they learnt from outside, because"]],[1801,["the approach has been more objective; so objective","approach is always little less than the subjective"]],[1807,["because subjective is from inside and objective is","from outside."]],[1811,["So when you go from the objective, the deviation"]],[1814,["into the main sound that","are coming from the inside, you see,"]],[1818,["the purity is little bit deviated."]],[1821,["And you know what is objective","and subjectivity approach."]],[1824,["So this has happened with some languages.","Some languages are very, very close to Sanskrit"]],[1833,["but they too took a turn according to their gunas."]],[1837,["Now, the Satvaguni (सत्त्वगुणि), the central","path or the Satvaguni as they call it, you see."]],[1845,["they are also the people who","have Satvaguna more in them;"]],[1851,["they see chakras in the right form."]],[1856,["But Satvagunis should not be","confused with the people who believe that"]],[1861,["if you eat this then this is satvik,","if you eat that that is tamasik"]],[1866,["or if you say this, this is satvik or if","you do not kill anybody then it is satvik."]],[1872,["In this the right perception","comes in. For example,"]],[1876,["you have to explain why","Krishna killed so many rakshasas."]],[1881,["It was absolutely satva; is","dharmic, absolutely dharmic."]],[1886,["Why Durga killed so many rakshasas? She","had to eat the blood of so many rakshasas."]],[1894,["So whatever is dharmic,"]],[1899,["the wisdom, the right path"]],[1903,["comes through such people who are"]],[1908,["neither too much this side, neither that side"]],[1912,["and they know exactly what is","the right way of looking at life."]],[1920,["Such born realised people: this is a","very, very far-fetched stuff they are very few."]],[1928,["I would say perhaps you","can say Buddha and Mahavira"]],[1935,["are the only two human beings","who have gone through many lives,"]],[1940,["from one extreme to another they went"]],[1944,["and ultimately they found out that","going to the extremes is not proper."]],[1950,["Still they have not reached the","complete height of an incarnation."]],[1956,["So a model was to be created"]],[1959,["who would all the time be giving","a fixed point for a person to rise to that."]],[1965,["And these are the different models","which are placed within us on our chakras."]],[1972,["And these models are perfect points belonging","to those chakras."]],[1978,["So according to the nature"]],[1983,["of the person who is watching these chakras,"]],[1988,["one sees them and gives them importance also."]],[1991,["Now for a person like say, [Adi] Shankacharya:"]],[1996,["Shankacharya is a born realised soul many a times."]],[2001,["He’s not born realised once, but","many a times he’s born realised,"]],[2004,["and he’s sort of, he’s in the centre of it","you can say, one of them, you can call him."]],[2009,["So when he talks of his Mooladhara chakra he is","sort of,"]],[2014,["he has already done the path many a times and","now he’s going to the subtler and subtler and subtler form."]],[2020,["So when he says that the Mooladhara chakra is","opened out then you can walk on the water it’s correct,"]],[2027,["because he is at that subtle stage of ascendence."]],[2032,["One has to ascend once,","second time, third time, forth times,"]],[2036,["and then you see, you reach a","stage where you start ascending."]],[2040,["But even then it is not so important to walk on the","water what is so important to walk on the water?"]],[2046,["It’s nothing so important because you","see it’s easy, you can take a boat and walk!"]],[2051,["It’s nothing so important! So walking on","the [water], means also on the right hand side;"]],[2057,["it’s a right-hand side to walk","on the water or to fly in the air,"]],[2062,["all this is the right-hand side things which","also can be done with the help of a boat,"]],[2069,["or what you call an aircraft","or even you can use a bhoot!"]],[2074,["For that you can use a dead entity and we","can make him take us to any place we feel like."]],[2082,["It can be done! This ESP business is only","that. So it can be done by other methods also."]],[2087,["So it is nothing important. You see, it’s sometimes very","confusing when we see that some people can fly in the air!"]],[2094,["They say in the subtle form they have gone. You don’t","see the body moving but you see that they they can feel it."]],[2100,["The difference being that","the people who are realised"]],[2103,["can guide themselves and can see the body moving"]],[2107,["but those who are not realised they","find that their subtle-being being taken out"]],[2112,["and their consciousness going with them somewhere","else and they’re sitting on top of the house;"]],[2116,["from there watching themselves and they’re sitting there","and they see themselves sitting down like that, you see."]],[2120,["These phenomenon take","place. That is absolutely nothing"]],[2123,["but a soul being ridden by a dead entity."]],[2131,["So there’s nothing great about","it. That is also right-side stuff."]],[2136,["The left hand side as I told you is","the emotional feeling about things."]],[2140,["You feel tremendous love for others","and sometimes you know people…"]],[2145,["I would say Sainath was one of them"]],[2148,["who had this left hand side gift","with him, and he was love personified"]],[2153,["and he was so much full of love for people that"]],[2160,["once there was a woman who was very","poor and she couldn’t celebrate her Diwali day"]],[2166,["and he couldn’t bear it so he gave her","some water and the water became like oil"]],[2170,["and she burnt lights in that; and it’s","a fact, you can do that, it’s possible."]],[2175,["And with this power you can","increase food, sort of thing you see."]],[2181,["you increase the food stuff, like Christ did it."]],[2184,["That’s also one side (left side). So","all these things come in a personality;"]],[2189,["some people have one more another has some","more and some people have all these qualities."]],[2194,["Some, those who are incarnations have everything.","They can do everything that they want to."]],[2198,["And they will use whatever they want to do and if","they don’t want use any powers they will not use."]],[2202,["So it depends on…"]],[2205,["so it’s nothing important, supposing you see","something alright, there you can see it is a good thing."]],[2211,["But that doesn’t mean that you should stick on to","those things but you must, try to do what you don’t see."]],[2216,["For example, now you see the","light coming out of somebody’s head,"]],[2222,["now that’s one side of looking at things.","Another is that you can feel the another person."]],[2229,["Don’t you feel the another person?","How he is, how he meets you,"]],[2235,["how you are coming closer to that person."]],[2238,["Can you feel that compassion for","him that he’s not where you are?"]],[2245,["That also is another balancing","stuff. But this should done..."]],[2249,["This is very dangerous for some people who try to be helpful","to others when they are not themselves solidified properly."]],[2255,["So I would again warn you that","when you start seeing lights and all that"]],[2258,["try to remember that you are going","on one side, you are seeing more."]],[2261,["Then be more compassionate in you","tongues, in your talking in your behaviour."]],[2265,["Try to have more love. Means right hand side is","more developing, the left is less; is the heart."]],[2271,["So you have to raise your Kundalini from right and","left, but this is all mechanical and it works out."]],[2275,["It’s only thinking about it, “Oh, I","have to develop my heart more,”"]],[2279,["the balance has to be there. This","also should develop feeling for others."]],[2282,["Now the feeling for others cannot","be explained as I feel for others."]],[2287,["I just, if somebody is crying anywhere","I get tears into my eyes automatically."]],[2291,["Even if you are not crying and if you are feeling","hurt about things I get this hurt feeling with Myself."]],[2297,["Like that, you see, you should really feel that","hurt feeling and that desperate feeling and that cry."]],[2304,["Of course I mean, it comes to some people","too much but they do not have the other side."]],[2308,["So you should have both the sides and","both the balancing directors within you."]],[2314,["So those who are seeing things more should","not go on bothering about what they are seeing."]],[2319,["“It’s coming that way, alright” because they","have done that kind of tapasya so they see things."]],[2323,["And it helps Sahaja Yoga very much because you can"]],[2328,["see for yourself who is realised","who’s not realised, this thing, that thing."]],[2331,["But still the dryness is in you."]],[2335,["So if it is in you, you should try to develop it."]],[2338,["So whatever you don’t have you try to develop","that. Whatever you have don’t be satisfied with that."]],[2343,["That’s the best way you can rise. Those people","who can see things should try to feel others."]],[2349,["Those who can feel others should see","things and it will work out that way."]],[2353,["So this is what it is. And in the","Mahakarana state where the Mahakarana is,"]],[2360,["that is a very, very subtlest form of state,"]],[2365,["where the chakras which have got the Deities"]],[2373,["are connected with the,"]],[2377,["are sort of a reflection of","the Deities of the Viraata."]],[2384,["Now these Deities in the","Viraata are reflected in you,"]],[2389,["are awakened in you and they start moving"]],[2392,["and making the whole","thing work out as it should be."]],[2398,["Up to the karana state it is very","good."]],[2401,["But the Mahakarana state is","the stage where it is the real –"]],[2405,["what you call the object – object and reflection."]],[2408,["When you can come up to the object which is a","really deep state of mind where you are with the object"]],[2416,["and when you are at the object you","are very close to an incarnation state."]],[2420,["So we can say that as far","as you people are concerned"]],[2428,["you should try to understand up to karana state,"]],[2431,["because beyond that how to jump and","how to go is not the question just now."]],[2436,["What’s the use of telling you about","something which is a far fetched stuff?"]],[2439,["So we’ll talk about it later. But this is","how it is the fourth stage of chakras."]],[2444,["Now, tentza prashna? Ah, te chakra. Ha.","(marathi: His question? Ah, about chakras. ok.)"]],[2448,["He says you see it anti-clockwise. You do see. Because most","of the people who have seen it have seen it on other people"]],[2454,["and when you see on other people from the","backside, you see it on the anti-clockwise side."]],[2459,["But, if you see it from the","front, it is clockwise, that’s why."]],[2463,["Yogi: No, what I am saying is","– you feel the chakras moving,"]],[2466,["you are outside your own body, still the","chakras are moving in an anti-clockwise manner."]],[2470,["Shri Mataji: Yes it depends on, you know,","what I’ve just now told you: that the chakras,"]],[2474,["say for example, for an ordinary human being","the chakras are nothing but ordinary plexuses;"]],[2479,["for a realised soul it is more than that."]],[2482,["So the more you move into a","greater view of your own awareness"]],[2487,["that’s how the chakras start manifesting.","Now for example my chakras are working all over."]],[2494,["All over. Do you see the difference?"]],[2498,["So it depends on the awareness of the person."]],[2502,["As much as the light now say; that much it shows","extension of the light, you see as much as the power."]],[2509,["So that is what it is."]],[2525,["Now is there are any questions left on chakras?","Yogi: About the number of petals."]],[2531,["Shri Mataji: Yes. Number of","petals are also gross stuff you see."]],[2535,["Till you go to a certain stage","where your petals are being created,"]],[2539,["because of a, there’s a little","mathematics about it, little mathematics."]],[2544,["And all this mathematics has been","worked out in a human being – how it is."]],[2549,["But these are the…we can say that now for example,"]],[2556,["in a person now, a light is there:"]],[2560,["say 25, what do you call? 25? Watts. 25 watts."]],[2566,["Now 25 watts are to be converted say"]],[2572,["to say 60 watts or something like that."]],[2576,["So we have to see the dimension into which the","person, means that portion, is going to grow, you see."]],[2582,["It’s a big mathematics about you. The","dimension to which that can grow you see"]],[2586,["and into what sphere it is going to penetrate."]],[2590,["For example, the Mooladhara chakra","you can take for an example now."]],[2597,["Mooladhara chakra is actually fourth that way,"]],[2602,["because it covers the four","sides of the human personality."]],[2606,["It’s in the abstract calculation,"]],[2611,["it is the fourth side of the personality. And the","fifth side, the movement in the fifth dimension,"]],[2617,["doesn’t take in the Mooladhara chakra.","It takes above the Mooladhara chakra."]],[2624,["So the fourth dimensions","as shown by that, you see."]],[2627,["These are the different dimensions of a man."]],[2630,["At those levels how many dimensions you","touch by these tattoos – it is calculated like that."]],[2637,["In My book I have given notes","of these in very great details as to"]],[2641,["what are the dimensions one","touches in this state and how far you go."]],[2646,["But the same Mooladhara becomes only two later on."]],[2650,["But it is such a subtle and sharp two","which penetrates just like this, all over."]],[2657,["So it depends on…you can say in a machine"]],[2662,["you have different types of","bones and different types of.."]],[2667,["screws and with different dates."]],[2671,["Now what is the calculation? Is","there any reason you can say why it is so?"]],[2676,["So it is a very detailed work and it’s all","worked out because the dimensions into which"]],[2680,["a human being will be going, all that is worked out,","and on that chakra only these is dimensions you achieve."]],[2686,["So it has a meaning. But it’s not","only four chakras. It’s not only four."]],[2691,["It has got many petals inside","and it’s a very interesting one."]],[2695,["Actually on Mooladhara I have written a big","chapter, complete. How many folds are inside"]],[2700,["and how these things work out and how many folds,"]],[2703,["what do they suggest and how far they open out,","because it’s all a dimension which is worked out."]],[2710,["For example, if you take a","banyan tree, the seed is so small."]],[2713,["A banyan tree has the smallest seed. Now","why is it so?"]],[2716,["And why is it so microscopic?","Because it is so dynamic."]],[2720,["For you this is all worked out like a capsule."]],[2724,["And it’s a capsule which is to work this","dimension, it has to work that dimension."]],[2729,["So it is rather a calculated","stuff – which I have described."]],[2733,["I have only described Mooladhara really in the fullest","because it makes such a big volume of one Mooladhara chakra,"]],[2741,["that I gave up about others. I","have just mentioned about them."]],[2744,["But only Mooladhara itself, when I started","describing, it became such a big, huge thing."]],[2749,["I gave in I said, “Now better not do other","ones.” But it’s quite a complicated stuff and,"]],[2757,["You see God has his own stage or style","of planning and we can’t question Him."]],[2763,["He does it according to His","own whim. He has his own style."]],[2766,["But [even] His whim has","understanding – everything has."]],[2771,["You will find that sometimes","if you try to study that."]],[2776,["If you ask Me certain things I try to","answer it in a different way, you see."]],[2781,["Because there are His ways of doing things","and He understands and that’s how He does it."]],[2786,["But still I have tried to bring","out at least Mooladhara chakra,"]],[2790,["so that human beings must understand that how complicated they are","made, how God has been so careful to place their Mooladhara so well"]],[2797,["and how He has put the force","there, how it’s a living machinery,"]],[2801,["how it’s working out so that people should","understand the importance of their chakras"]],[2805,["and importance of their being, how","important you are. You are not ordinary people."]],[2809,["Even if there’s a say an ordinary","tape recorder, we are so careful about it."]],[2815,["How much we should be careful about our own machinery, which is","being created in ages with such great understanding, such mechanism!"]],[2822,["Every chakra if you take up, even if you take","up three yugas, you won’t understand one chakra."]],[2828,["It is such a tremendous working inside."]],[2830,["I have of course given only the description of it"]],[2836,["and the reason why is a stage","which will make you really mad!"]],[2841,["But I’ve tried to explain in that. You have read my","Mooladhara did you? It’s quite an elaborate stuff."]],[2851,["Question: In Delhi, the question","was “what is the purpose of life?”"]],[2856,["...said of all these incarnations","is to go in Nirvana which is..."]],[2862,["nothing happened then"]],[2866,["...Of self perfection which is concieve as,","so tell you are one with God which is immovability"]],[2871,["Now you said you cannot like this, you are","going to incarnate, I mean liberation is not just,"]],[2877,["something which is demobilize some what,","you are going to incarnate again and again."]],[2882,["Then the question I would","like to ask, the connection..."]],[2885,["what is the purpose of life? I understood before but the","simple thing is to be united with God, whatever this means"]],[2891,["and when I you enlighten because","there is no movement anymore but"]],[2894,["Shri Mataji: that stage I never","cancelled it, that stage is not today."]],[2898,["You see when I said it that just now you have to","incarnate again and again. You are not at that stage."]],[2903,["But when the whole thing…you see,","nothing is wrong in any one of these."]],[2907,["When they say, “There is a day of judgement.”","But before that God is going to give you a chance."]],[2913,["He is going to give you a full chance","to improve yourself go to that position."]],[2917,["You see, like that, we can say that, first","the trees are brought into the by sowing the seeds"]],[2923,["then the trees grow up, then there are flowers,","then the flowers are again, they become seeds."]],[2929,["Then again the trees and again this","thing, until again they reach a certain stage,"]],[2932,["till they have completely ripened then they remove the","whole thing and the whole thing becomes the Brahma itself."]],[2939,["And whatever is a waste matter","is thrown out. So ultimately it’s the union."]],[2943,["But the “union of your being” means with God."]],[2947,["It’s a much greater state.","First of all it’s the purification point."]],[2952,["You see for your purification you are to be born again. You have not","reached that stage where you should become Mahanirvana, have you?"]],[2959,["If you become, might be you might","land up in hell so better not try that!"]],[2963,["See, you must understand that just now,","at this stage you have to go further,"]],[2968,["purifying yourself till you reach a certain stage you","see where, when you reach a certain stage, at that time,"]],[2974,["God has given you enough chance,","enough chance to improve yourself."]],[2978,["still you are rakshasas then you are not going to","be tried anymore."]],[2982,["But it’s quite clear, I must say.","You cannot now allow it to take to chance."]],[2993,["One of the butchery is going to be very close,","is very close; I mean I would say can be anytime."]],[2999,["So you be careful I mean, it’s just there."]],[3003,["So many have to be neutralised","because they are just very troublesome."]],[3011,["So it can be quite close","so just be careful about it."]],[3014,["So, you see, if everything fits into everything","else but what happens is every religion,"]],[3019,["part of it is said so this cuts out the other."]],[3022,["Supposing I say, “You have to go to this room,” now","if I say that, “You have to come two steps that side,”"]],[3027,["and then I say, “You have to come three steps this","side,” these are all connected stuff"]],[3031,["but because it is said only three steps here so you said,","“Then in that religion it is said three steps inside you"]],[3037,["and what about those two steps?”","I have to tell about them also."]],[3040,["Because I have to tell about all","those two steps you have to take first,"]],[3043,["I better not tell about these three steps","because you’ll put your eyes, oh, very nice."]],[3047,["It’s not going to come in a plate."]],[3050,["You have to work it out consciously."]],[3054,["Understand now?"]],[3058,["Yogi: Last time you were saying that after death, in","which Atma and the Kundalini, do they end up somewhere?"]],[3064,["Shri Mataji: Body."]],[3067,["But where do the go, the chakras go?"]],[3070,["Shri Mataji: Chakra's exist","within you, chakras is a place."]],[3073,["They just only exist within you.","Yogi: Within the Earth element?"]],[3078,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no.","Yogi: How is it going?"]],[3080,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no. They are in the body only, they are in the","body. The body is itself like a seed, you see, you become like a seed."]],[3086,["But they are potent. You can’t","see them. Chakra is a state."]],[3090,["Yogi: I think chakra and","kundalini must be living together?"]],[3095,["Shri Mataji: No, no. It is something like","a light going out and the tube is still there."]],[3101,["It is like that the Kundalini. But it","stays on top of the head of the person."]],[3105,["The only difference is, supposing,","the light goes out and stays near by."]],[3108,["You see the potential is","there in the light. It is like that."]],[3112,["The place for the light to pass is there."]],[3116,["Question: (inaudible)..and one more thing.."]],[3128,["then that particular person goes to both..."]],[3133,["Shri Mataji: Extremes.","Yogi: The extremes and in that creates,"]],[3136,["you know what happens before","realisation? Whether they are..."]],[3144,["Shri Mataji: No, no. They’re already separated in the","gross they are separated; inside also they’re separated"]],[3150,["but there’s a void because yes,","that is the only point."]],[3156,["You see, the Kundalini gets enlightened"]],[3159,["or sort of she gets a little","enlightened you can say"]],[3163,["when it faces me and it immediately","starts rising. Or when you people,"]],[3166,["because you are also Sahaja Yogis."]],[3169,["It doesn’t happen with anybody","else you will be amazed you know."]],[3174,["So now what is the other question?"]],[3193,["Question: How do the chakras","move in the body; is it horizontally?"]],[3197,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes. That is","true, they are moving horizontally."]],[3200,["They are moving horizontal","but when you move them like this, you see;"]],[3203,["like you have seen the wheel…","Question: Why not you go this way?"]],[3206,["Shri Mataji: No it doesn’t work out. It works out better this","way. Because these are the things that are emitting, you see."]],[3213,["If you do it like this it goes down. This","way these are moving you can move this."]],[3218,["You have seen that in a watch there are","some like this parallel and some are like this."]],[3228,["Ata dusra kai prashna ahe? (marathi:","now what other question is there?)"]],[3236,["Yogini: Mataji, you said the","different gurus have different..."]],[3242,["the fake gurus have damaged the chakras."]],[3247,["How do they do it? And what’s to be done about it?"]],[3254,["Shri Mataji: You see, what gurus do is","they use different chakras"]],[3259,["for introducing into the sympathetic nervous system","some entities which they have controlled, you see."]],[3266,["They do not control","many entities as such, but what happens,"]],[3271,["for example now I would say, during war many","people died just like that; killed and this and that."]],[3277,["In those countries, those souls,"]],[3281,["you see they were never,","sort of - well never had a human life"]],[3287,["and they were treated just like animals","and they were very much tortured."]],[3291,["So they had that feeling in their minds","that, “We should also torture these people.”"]],[3296,["So when they die they do not die really and","they do not get into the pretloka (Spirit world)."]],[3303,["They stay in the atmosphere and","that’s why wars are very bad things,"]],[3306,["because wars create such human","beings much more, with accidents and"]],[3310,["people who are very","depraved in life, very dissatisfied"]],[3313,["who are doing all kinds of depraved actions and"]],[3316,["secretive things and all kinds","of horrid things. All such people, all of them,"]],[3321,["when they die they do not","really go to pretaloka because"]],[3325,["they don’t think of their salvation but","they are just thinking of their lust, greed"]],[3330,["or we can say possessions,"]],[3334,["those who are grabbing things,","thieves and all sorts of people."]],[3339,["We can call ‘evil’ people and","satanic people, when they die"]],[3344,["they find they become much","more subtler and they can be"]],[3348,["better off if they act in a subtle body."]],[3351,["So they use the subtle body for acting","into people and such people are easily available."]],[3355,["So these gurus, what they do, that","they themselves are evil geniuses,"]],[3358,["and they have a way of capturing","those people and they use them."]],[3362,["And they introduce to you","through your different chakras."]],[3365,["For example, Ravana had a capacity to speak and","in his speech he used to introduce rakshasas"]],[3370,["into the human beings in Ceylon.","Otherwise imagine in Lanka,"]],[3374,["people should never fight Rama, because at","that time the sensitivity of people was so great"]],[3380,["that they knew that Rama was an incarnation.","They were not gross as today they are that,"]],[3384,["one has to tell that, “Oh,","here I am the incarnation.”"]],[3387,["That time it was not Kali Yuga so","they knew he was an incarnation."]],[3390,["And so many of them, I mean some of them did not,","but quite a lot of them knew and despite that"]],[3396,["nobody could oppose it because their,"]],[3400,["mind was captured by these entities","put by Ravana and they fought Him."]],[3404,["So, it was so, even at the time of","Krishna: people knew who He was at least"]],[3408,["they had quite an idea,","even Kauravas new about it."]],[3411,["But this Kali Yuga is a wretched","thing – nobody see anything clearly."]],[3415,["But those times were not like that. People knew","who was an incarnation and they understood it."]],[3421,["At that time also, these people had to use","some sort of a way of putting them off and"]],[3427,["they used this method of enticement."]],[3429,["And when they used this","method of enticement, in that use,"]],[3433,["they learned also subtler ways and subtler ways which they","are using in Kali Yuga very well. They are actually rakshasas"]],[3439,["and they know these methods – how to","entice people. There are so many ways of doing it."]],[3444,["And when you bend your head before them"]],[3448,["that is the best time when they can put it into your","ego and they can finish you off for once for all."]],[3453,["So that’s how they do it.","And you are no more yourself!"]],[3456,["First of all they act on your heart: you become a nervous","person your hands start shaking your feet start shaking;"]],[3462,["they act on your heart chakra.","You lose the power of raksha"]],[3465,["which is the basic point of the heart chakra."]],[3472,["And then, once you start losing the","grip over your nerves you find that"]],[3478,["as if somebody is doing for you. And if you take somebody’s name you","start jumping and you don’t know anything – it’s an experience, you see."]],[3483,["There are so many things they","do like that: thousand and one."]],[3487,["But human beings, as a whole in the Kali Yuga,"]],[3492,["instead of improving has","gone down absolutely in his,"]],[3497,["conception of Divinity and in everything."]],[3501,["I mean he’s a hopeless case otherwise! But","by God’s grace Sahaja Yoga may save him."]],[3506,["They way it is I mean he’s very, very blunt."]],[3510,["He cannot seek, he’s very insensitive.","And he carries on all kinds of his malpractices"]],[3517,["thinking that he’s a rare saint ever born.","You see that’s another great quality of Kali Yuga!"]],[3525,["This is the problem. They have no conscience left now to","tell them that this is wrong or that is wrong they’ve killed it."]],[3531,["Everywhere it is so."]],[3536,["Tumhi shalid shi mulad ka? (marathi: your kids are in school?)","Yogi: Ho. (yes) Shri Mataji: Achcha (ok)."]],[3544,["Ata dusra prashna (marathi: now another question)"]],[3564,["Yogi: How music works on the five chakras?"]],[3570,["Shri Mataji: You see all these five elements"]],[3573,["are very important in our body and they"]],[3578,["are the body of the chakras","also as I have told you."]],[3581,["So what happens that, when you sing the music,"]],[3585,["the vibrations can go through the musical","sound and can excite certain chakras."]],[3592,["You see for example for the","hriday (heart) chakra is very good"]],[3596,["or also for the Vishuddhi chakra it is very good."]],[3599,["Not for all the","chakras. But certain chakras it does."]],[3602,["But supposing you say a mantra","that’s the sound, with beautiful music"]],[3608,["and a realised soul then","it is very effective, you see."]],[3611,["For example, Ganesha you can","excite him with a beautiful sloka"]],[3617,["if you are a realised soul and if your Ganesha is correct,","you can excite the Ganesha of another person very easily,"]],[3623,["I mean such a person do it. So music,","sound, all these things have an effect and"]],[3630,["we are now using that method very extensively.","But supposing now, we go in a mass meditation and"]],[3636,["many people are there and some","chakra is caught, say Vishuddhi is caught,"]],[3640,["I can correct their Vishuddhi by just","putting My finger on this, like this,"]],[3643,["because this has the sound, this is in the chakras, there","is a micro-sound which is carrying the vibrations, you see."]],[3651,["Actually the part of the vibrations is the","micro-sound also, micro-light, micro-sound"]],[3656,["and you can say all the five elements are","micro there."]],[3659,["So when I put my finger the micro sound can carry","the rest of them and the person can be corrected."]],[3664,["We can do it. Specially Vishuddhi.","Very easy to correct Vishuddhi on that."]],[3667,["You can correct most of the things but","certain things are very easily corrected."]],[3671,["Vishuddhi, which is responsible for the","sound, made from the sound element."]],[3681,["As we have seen that water element is very","good for treating people for the lower chakras,"]],[3688,["because up to the heart chakra, because the","water and salt can help you for the Nabhi chakra"]],[3696,["and because salt is the earth element"]],[3701,["and what do you call it?","It is essence of the ocean and"]],[3706,["the essence of the ocean is in the bhavasagara. So","we can use salt water for clearing the lower chakras."]],[3712,["We can use light for the eyes because,","this is made out of the prakash – light element."]],[3720,["Like that different things can be done."]],[3724,["And with these different elements if you use them, you can","make all the dirt or all the obstructions, which are collected,"]],[3733,["in your particular chakra by putting","them back into the same element"]],[3739,["and cleansing","them out so the element takes it away."]],[3742,["For Mother Earth also, She has so many elements in","Her that She can take away so many of your problems"]],[3748,["which are troubling you, in your being,"]],[3752,["because of some imbalance","of the Mother Earth element."]],[3758,["You see, this is all due to the imbalance of these elements","in you, accumulated more beyond than what you want it."]],[3766,["That’s why I said, “the extreme of it.”"]],[3771,["Prithvi tattwa (earth element)","is expressed through Shri Ganesh"]],[3775,["and Shri Ganesh is the form of the,"]],[3779,["you can say the purified","principle of the Earth element"]],[3785,["and is the same. I mean,"]],[3791,["in a flute you have two notes,"]],[3798,["the first and the last are the same.","In the same way in a human being the seven notes,"]],[3804,["the first one is","a Ganesha and the last one is also a Ganesha."]],[3807,["So these seven notes are the same."]],[3810,["And these seven notes make the Earth element"]],[3818,["and not completely Earth","element but started with earth element purified."]],[3825,["When it loses its Earth","element problems completely"]],[3828,["it is Parabrahma, I mean it becomes all Brahma."]],[3831,["Because Earth element is, outside is","the Earth element but inside is dhara,"]],[3839,["is dhara, is dharana – is the power","to sustain, is the power to sustain."]],[3846,["And that power is the purest","form of Earth principle (tattwa)."]],[3852,["So, that you become later on; gradually the whole","Earth element drops down and you become that."]],[3858,["So it is the dharana shakti as they","call it: the power of sustenance."]],[3863,["Is the Ganesha."]],[3867,["So, like that, in every chakra you have","a very subtle and subtle-most point."]],[3872,["And that subtle-most point is the note that"]],[3877,["the Divine is playing at","that point, because every note"]],[3881,["has a different frequency, a","different intonation you can call it,"]],[3886,["a different sound, which helps","in the melody of this Universe."]],[3893,["So, like that, we have seven chakras and the seven","notes."]],[3896,["And they are different notes but these","notes then create permutations and combinations"]],[3902,["and that is how a chakra gets into a","swara (musical note) and then it becomes a"]],[3909,["a sound, and from a sound it becomes a word,","and from word it becomes a language and"]],[3914,["like that it goes on and the same subtle","form starts becoming something else."]],[3920,["For example if I have love for my children:"]],[3924,["what, how I express it? I make a house for them,"]],[3927,["I make a place to live for them, I cook","food for them, I make a bed for them."]],[3933,["It’s a gross expression","of that subtle love I have."]],[3936,["In the same way whatever is subtle","within us is expressed outside"]],[3941,["with the help of the elements that are outside,"]],[3944,["to express the subtle through","our gross behaviour or gross"]],[3952,["material things also we do."]],[3955,["So, it’s the same subtle,","which is expressing outside."]],[3958,["But then we become so gross","later on that we forget the inner part of it."]],[3963,["You see for a Mother may create","something, all these things and"]],[3966,["then she becomes so possessive of her children,","she’ll think, “I’ve done so much for my children,” that"]],[3970,["she wouldn’t even think why she has made it!"]],[3972,["She forgets the love part of it and she becomes","nothing but the gross thing."]],[3976,["She just starts scolding the children,","even for a small thing here and there."]],[3980,["You see she does this for love, and then she","forgets it. That’s what is an extreme behaviour."]],[3984,["Extreme behaviour means, from the subtle, you get","to the gross and the gross, and the grosser."]],[3989,["Once you become grosser you are dead."]],[3993,["Ata kai prashna? (Marathi: Now what question?)"]],[4000,["Yogi: (asks question about badhas)"]],[4009,["Shri Mataji: Those who can see badhas are","on the emotional side. They can see the badhas."]],[4014,["There also you can see two types of people."]],[4017,["Those who already themselves in badha, they can","see badhas, very clearly; they can see the dead persons."]],[4024,["Those who are already badha can see","that another person who has got a badha"]],[4027,["because they are in the collective subconscious","themselves, so they can see. And a person the one say,"]],[4034,["he can see the one who, supposing,","who is a drunkard – He can see."]],[4041,["A person who is drunk can see a badha in another","person because he is a subconscious type, he likes it."]],[4046,["But some people can achieve a state in an","emotional way that they can see badha clearly."]],[4053,["If they are realised souls, the emotional state,","people say, the bhakti people can see badha there."]],[4060,["But even the supra-conscious people","can see a light coming before them,"]],[4066,["they can see somebody standing","before them like a light and then say,"]],[4069,["that, “There’s a light coming.” They might","get fragrance or things like that can happen. They can."]],[4075,["They are called as tanmatras"]],[4079,["is the causal principle of all","the Universe, causal – tanmatras."]],[4087,["Means for Earth the causal principle is fragrance."]],[4093,["So, supposing somebody has done","a lot of search in the field of say,"]],[4101,["earth element, so such","a person can get a lot of fragrance, can;"]],[4109,["It is a variety everywhere created","because of their different searches"]],[4115,["and because of their different seeking."]],[4131,["You see badha, just say","somebody has a badha or not."]],[4135,["If he has Agya and a heart it’s definitely","a badha."]],[4139,["And you just ask the person to put their hands before","the photograph and he starts shaking. Normally he shakes."]],[4160,["You see I don’t know how you should make","it out but it’s really easy you can make out the,"]],[4164,["cannot put their eyes towards","my photograph. If you ask them to close their"]],[4168,["eyes their eyes will start flickering, hands","will start shaking, eyes will always flicker."]],[4173,["Slightest... will show on the eyelids like this."]],[4177,["You see badha, can be of many types."]],[4181,["Some people just have for the time being, some people","have permanent residence. Some have bags full! You see."]],[4187,["So you just can’t say what it will be."]],[4211,["You just don’t worry about these things."]],[4217,["You see the thing is people think that there’s only one","type of badha, emotional badha. There can be both types,"]],[4223,["a person who is very","egotistical also is dominated by somebody else."]],[4228,["Abnormal area, abnormal behaviour, who","is not a normal person, can come from anywhere."]],[4263,["There is no difference","between sunlight and sun, moonlight and moon."]],[4270,["So there is no difference at all. It is only","the human beings who think there are two stuffs."]],[4286,["Which is an advaita (non-duality),","which one and the same thing is it."]],[4292,["For example, now this","bangle is beautifying my hand,"]],[4297,["so what is the difference between","this bangle and the beautification?"]],[4304,["Is the quality of a person."]],[4311,["Is the quality. It's the,"]],[4315,["we can say the ?? and ??, you can call it."]],[4321,["You will take out the rest of it and you","will say that this is all useless. It’s not that."]],[4325,["You see,","in every thing this is all there, it’s one."]],[4330,["What is the essence of sunlight and sun?","Sun has no meaning without sunlight."]],[4335,["Sunlight has no meaning without sun."]],[4341,["It is not essence, it is everything but."]],[4345,["We can say water and a ice."]],[4351,["Yogi: Existence and essence,","I mean are just recycled two categories..?"]],[4355,["Shri Mataji: No.","Yogi: No, it's not that."]],[4357,["Shri Mataji: No, it's about having","wisdom and both having sense."]],[4361,["There is no difference at all, you see."]],[4365,["Human beings cannot conceive it, that’s the trouble","with the human mind, because it is an advaita,"]],[4370,["so human beings cannot see it.","They think of two things always."]],[4375,["You see through perception it is","not possible for you to perceive it,"]],[4378,["but you can understand by analysing. Many","things human beings can’t understand."]],[4383,["You just cannot, because you have a limited brain,","you have a limited awareness, you have limited love."]]]);
